				\begin{document}$$\begin{array}{*{20}c} {MAP = \frac{1}{\left| P \right|}\mathop \sum \limits_{p}^{P} AvgP\left( p \right)} \\ \end{array}$$\end{document}MAP=1P∑pPAvgPp

where AvgP(p) is defined in Eq. 77\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
